DE:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Ich hab da 'ne Idee!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wie wär's, wenn
wir heute mal bei dir trainieren?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Haha! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Um ehrlich zu sein, wollte ich
einfach mal deine Bude sehen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Was meinst du?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Klar! Sehr gerne!
Heute hab ich Ruhetag.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I was thinking it'd be cool if
we hung out at your place today.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}It seems like we could really get
some bro-{{TAG:000E:0006:0600620072006F000E006C00610064007900620072006F00}} bonding done.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
So how about it?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Sounds good!
I can't today.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wäre es nicht klasse, wenn wir
heute bei dir rumhängen würden?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Wir könnten dann endlich mal von
Sportsfreund zu {{TAG:000E:0006:1800530070006F0072007400730066007200650075006E0064001C00530070006F0072007400730066007200650075006E00640069006E00}}
reden und viel Spaß haben!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Was sagst du dazu?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Tolle Idee!
Heute ist schlecht.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bugün senin evde takılsak bayağı iyi olur
diye düşündüm.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Sağlam bir kanka-{{TAG:000E:0006:0600620072006F000E006C00610064007900620072006F00}}
kaynaşması yaşarız.
{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Ee, ne dersin?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Olur!
Bugün yapamam.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I've patrolled all over this town, but
I haven't seen much of your place.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I think maybe I should patrol near
you and check it out, you know?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I want you to feel safe and secure!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Gotta keep the peace in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
What do you think?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Patrol on over!
Patrol elsewhere!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Bu kasabanın her yerinde devriye attım ama senin
evini pek göremedim.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Belki senin
taraflarda da devriye atıp
bir gözden geçirmeliyim, ne dersin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Kendini güvende
hissetmeni istiyorum!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}'da huzuru korumak şart!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ne dersin?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Devriyeye gel!
Başka yerde devriye at!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Şöyle düşündüm de, evine bir göz atmak isterim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kaynaşmak için iyi bir yöntem gibi.
Ne diyorsun? Var mısın?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Varım! Gel!
Yokum! Uzak dur!

